<view class="page-root">
  <navigation-bar title="关于极简小帐" back="{{true}}" />
  <scroll-view scroll-y class="page-body">
    <view class="hero-card">
      <text class="hero-title">把记账做得更轻，也更稳</text>
      <text class="hero-desc">极简小帐聚焦日常收支、预算提醒、定期规则和待处理草稿，让个人记账更连续、更少打断。</text>
      <view class="hero-meta-row">
        <view class="hero-meta-pill">
          <text class="hero-meta-kicker">当前版本</text>
          <text class="hero-meta-value">{{version}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="hero-meta-pill">
          <text class="hero-meta-kicker">定位</text>
          <text class="hero-meta-value">轻量本地记账</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <text class="section-title">当前能力</text>
    <view class="group-card">
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-title">日常记账</text>
        <text class="info-desc">支持手动录入、语音输入、图片扫描和记录检索。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="divider"></view>
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-title">预算与提醒</text>
        <text class="info-desc">支持总预算、分类预算、阈值提醒和待处理草稿提醒。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="divider"></view>
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-title">定期账单</text>
        <text class="info-desc">适合房租、工资、会员费等固定收支，按节奏自动生成待处理草稿。</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <text class="section-title">数据与隐私</text>
    <view class="group-card">
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-title">本地优先</text>
        <text class="info-desc">头像、昵称、账单、预算、定期规则等数据默认保存在当前设备。</text>
      </view>
      <view class="divider"></view>
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-title">可导出可备份</text>
        <text class="info-desc">支持导出 CSV 和完整备份文件，适合留存与迁移。</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <text class="section-title">版本信息</text>
    <view class="group-card">
      <view class="version-row">
        <text class="version-label">App 版本</text>
        <text class="version-value">{{version}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="divider"></view>
      <view class="info-row">
        <text class="info-title">设计方向</text>
        <text class="info-desc">用尽量少的页面负担，承接频繁发生的记账动作。</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="footer-note">
      <text class="footer-note-text">如果你发现哪里不顺手，欢迎从“我的 > 意见反馈”继续告诉我。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="page-gap"></view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
